Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.06,1:04:44.97,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}螺旋形般逝去的时间
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.41,1:04:50.49,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}缓缓坠下 你在找寻着
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.26,1:04:55.99,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}昨天往今天延续
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.43,1:05:06.19,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}遥远的往昔 离别的人们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.68,1:05:16.88,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}只要转一圈 就在你身边
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.76,1:05:23.19,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}时间是螺旋的阶梯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.90,1:05:28.89,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}连接着离别
